@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title State Reconciliation
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Callback Intent Collection" as Intents
rectangle "Policy Check" as Policy
rectangle "Allowed Change Merge" as Merge
rectangle "Substrate Application" as Apply
rectangle "Invalid Intent Rejection" as Reject

Intents --> Policy : asks runtime policy for
Policy --> Merge : admits allowed intent to
Merge --> Apply : writes merged changes into
Policy --> Reject : routes invalid intent to
@enduml
